	(descr "Vishay VBPW34S silicon PIN photodiode, gullwing SMD, 4.4x3.9mm body, 6.4mm lead span, 7.5mm2 radiant sensitive area (3x3mm chip drawn on F.Fab). Pad 1 = cathode (silkscreen bar side), pad 2 = anode: the footprint is MIRRORED relative to the datasheet top view, which shows the anode on the left. Land pattern is the datasheet recommended solder pad (8.9mm overall, 5.4mm gap, 1.75x1.8mm pads). Reflow only. https://www.vishay.com/docs/81128/vbpw34s.pdf")
	(tags "photodiode VBPW34S BPW34 gullwing opto Vishay")
